o Communication Plan
o Means for Controls and Monitoring
o Schedule, Budget, and Cost Baseline Information
o Quality management Approach

A.8.d. Schedule and Progress Reporting

Schedule and progress reporting requirements herein are the minimum required.  The City may withhold
Payment until the PEP and the baseline schedule is approved.
